    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/c4eb0b5962295f36e8e65d8e140ca943.avif?t=1706622774\" /></div><br><br>There is a lot of stuff to add to Ooglians, and we want <strong>YOU</strong> to be a part of the process!<br>Community feedback is key for prioritizing what to work on next, such as<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Expand base building<br></li><li>Add more ooglian types<br></li><li>Polish existing gameplay<br></li><li>Add non-gameplay stuff like stats, achievements, high-score</li></ul><br>Head on over to our Discord and let us know what you want to see in the game next!<br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/8b57c326bec49fe277d66fb78be9c232.mp4?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The tower defense base builder you never realized you wanted!<br>Straight out of a fever dream, here is... Ooglians!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What are Ooglians?</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/81dc9084c9392762f394fd37e2dda0fd.mp4?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Ooglians are a mysterious species.<br>It's unknown whether they are technophobes or destructophiles,<br>but they sure love smashing machinery to bits.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are not an Ooglian.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/6b8c51e499e549720826584b0ad0bca8.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/6b8c51e499e549720826584b0ad0bca8.webm?t=1706622774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>You are... you. It's not up to me to tell you who you are.<br><i>Why</i> are you on this planet?<br><i>What</i> is your goal?<br>It is, as of now, unknown. Maybe if you protect your reactor, you'll find out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.apng?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Build the base around your reactor<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.apng?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Ooglians are attracted by the machinery<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.apng?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Ooglians try to destroy your base<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/06366c8727c328e12443157e635dc980.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/06366c8727c328e12443157e635dc980.apng?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Build more machines to defend your base<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/fdc754751da706185cbc8f1bd48a301b.apng?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> Attract more ooglians<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/94449cda041a80a925ed63ab56deaf05.apng?t=1706622774\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> It's a game loop<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162070/extras/b9102a2190eec7fe2e80a272a74abb49.poster.avif?t=1706622774\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: